The withdrawal seems to be a sucess. The <span style="color: #DE0100;">Republicans</span> are attempting to spin this outcome in 2 ways. They are attempting to give Trump the credit for negotiating the initial withdrawal deal in the first place, while also critizing us for leaving the Afgan army in such an unfavorable position. Still, Americans are generally satisified with how the operation played out.
